  <h2>Progression Over Time</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Week 1-2:</strong> Learn form, 3-4 exercises if needed</li>
    <li><strong>Week 3-4:</strong> Complete all 7, improve timing</li>
    <li><strong>Week 5-6:</strong> Increase speed, reduce rest</li>
    <li><strong>Week 7+:</strong> Add variations, extend hold times</li>
  </ul>

